@startuml part-IV.request-xml
title UBL XML element structure - part-IV.request
hide empty members

class "QualificationApplicationRequest" as E0 {
}

class "QualificationApplicationRequest/cac:TenderingCriterion" as E1 {
  +cbc:ID
  +cbc:CriterionTypeCode
  +cbc:Name
}

class "QualificationApplicationRequest/cac:TenderingCriterionProperty" as E2 {
  +cbc:ID
  +cbc:ExpectedValueNumeric
  +cbc:ExpectedDescription
  +cbc:MinimumAmount
}

E0 --> "1" E1
E0 --> "1" E2

note as N1
  Elements sharing a wrapper name (e.g. cac:TenderingCriterionProperty)
  are collapsed into ONE class showing ALL possible bodies. At runtime
  each instance carries exactly one body (Schematron BR-TCR-03).
end note
@enduml
